rst game in a guided battle of Aang versus Zuko. Choose your side and send your forces to your opponent while learning essential gameplay lessons\r\n<br>• GUIDED LEARN-TO-PLAY EXPERIENCE—Start by playing a tutorial game with two 20-card decks, each with a step-by-step guide booklet that will walk you through your first game\r\n<br>• MIX & MATCH THEMED DECKS—Once you’ve conquered the basics, master the remaining elements with eight 20-card Avatar: The Last Airbender-themed decks; just combine any two and you’re ready to go!\r\n<br>• EVERYTHING YOU NEED TO PLAY—This Beginner Box includes everything you and a friend need to play, including 2 Playmats that will show you where to place your cards, 2 Spindowns to track your life totals, and 1 Rules Reference booklet to answer any questions you have along the way\r\n<br>• WELCOME TO THE GATHERING—Magic: The Gathering is a collectible card game that weaves deep strategy, gorgeous art, fantastical stories, and a thriving fan community all together into a card game experience like no other\r\n<br>\r\n<br>Each Avatar: The Last Airbender - Beginner Box contains the following:\r\n<br>• Two 20-card tutorial decks (Aang and Zuko)\r\n<br>• 8 Avatar: The Last Airbender-themed decks (20 cards each)\r\n<br>• 2 Playmats\r\n<br>• 2 Spindown Life Counters\r\n<br>• 2 Learn-to-Play Guides\r\n<br>• 5 double-sided tokens\r\n<br>• 1 Rules Reference booklet"},{"name":"UPC","displayName":"UPC","value":"195166290669"}]},{"productId":675733,"name":"Avatar: The Last Airbender - Play Pack","cleanName":"Avatar The Last Airbender Play Pack","imageUrl":"https://tcgplayer-cdn.tcgplayer.com/product/675733_200w.jpg","categoryId":1,"groupId":24421,"url":"https://www.tcgplayer.com/product/675733/magic-avatar-the-last-airbender-avatar-the-last-airbender-play-pack","modifiedOn":"2026-01-29T19:58:49.15","imageCount":1,"presaleInfo":{"isPresale":false,"releasedOn":null,"note":null},"extendedData":[{"name":"OracleText","displayName":"Rules Text Contains","value